## Architecture (planned)

```
src/app/
  (public)/
    page.tsx
    projects/
    blog/
    contact/
  (admin)/
    layout.tsx
    projects/
    blog/
src/components/
  ui/         // MUI-based components
  sections/   // Tailwind + layout components
src/lib/
  db.ts       // Prisma client
  auth.ts     // Auth.js config
prisma/
  schema.prisma
src/app/api/
  auth/[...nextauth]/route.ts // NextAuth API route
```

## Data models (current)

See [prisma/schema.prisma](mdc:prisma/schema.prisma) for `Project`, `BlogPost`, and `User` models.

## Content Structure

- **Public Pages**: Home, Projects, Blog, Contact
- **Admin Pages**: Dashboard, Manage Projects, Manage Blog Posts

## Best Practices

- Server Components by default; client components only when needed
- Per‑route SEO metadata via Metadata API
- Tailwind for layout; MUI for component polish
- Validate inputs with Zod
- Consider ISR + tag‑based revalidation and security headers as the project evolves

## Deployment & Hosting

- Vercel for hosting; DB on Supabase or Vercel Postgres
- Auto‑deploy from GitHub `main`

